"<br>कृपया एमएसएन आईडी जाँच गर्नुहोस् ।</qt>"

#: protocols/msn/msnnotifysocket.cpp:133
msgid ""
"<qt>An internal error occurred in the MSN plugin."
"<br>MSN Error: %1"
